// Dual-master, size-native (mirrors Fluent's own per-size masters). Figma's Atom.Button uses the
// 16px Folder Multiple (Slot.Icon Size=16 -> glyph 14.7x12.6), whose strokes are tuned for 16px; the
// 20px master rendered small under-fills the slot and looks thinner. So at size<=16 we render the
// 16px-native master, fitted into the viewBox-20 frame via scale(1.25) (the IconNumberCircle1 pattern)
// so the whole set stays viewBox 20. At size=16 net scale is (16/20)*1.25 = 1.0, i.e. the 16px master
// renders at true 1:1 -> pixel-exact to Figma. size>16 keeps the 20px master (nav/badge usage) unchanged.
